# Go workspace
#
# A go.work spanning the root and nexus/ would collapse the module boundary the
# whole design rests on: `go build ./...` would start resolving Nexus, and the
# separation would stop being enforced by anything. One may exist locally for a
# debugging session; it must never be committed.
go.work
go.work.sum
vendor/

# Docs (mdBook build output)
docs/book/

